WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Prepare a stable setup: Arrange a water container, pre-filled tube and measuring cup.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.400
Use gravity: Keep the outlet lower than the water level and secure tubing.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.600
Collect the flow: Time how long the collected water takes to reach a mark.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.800
Calculate Q: Example: 250 mL in 20 s is a flow rate of 12.5 mL/s.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:21.000
Change one factor: Vary the tube length or diameter while keeping other conditions similar.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.200
Discuss the limits: Changing the water height changes the pressure head during a trial.

